            <div xml:id="m-69915a9f-4a59-4ccd-8820-d41ddeb88dce">
              <lg xml:id="m-8a43e642-21bf-44a9-a2f7-6d086649a17d">
                <l xml:id="m-c98d44fb-462d-4dc1-8b5d-af1deeb09ef0" facs="#m-a29c8b57-b527-4444-972e-5cc64ae6781e" label="ambiguous">Beatus vir. 3. a: 8. — 4. 8.</l><l xml:id="m-f607b69b-16ae-491e-bc7e-fbb18d80b427" facs="#m-274db860-843b-4067-a188-e6180cde182c" label="ambiguous">143</l><l xml:id="m-2592613a-a762-4464-984b-b408b10464a7" facs="#m-14e72b28-3fd1-48b7-97f0-09df089c4a2a" label="ambiguous">Tone 3. a», g.</l><l xml:id="m-c72957cb-ba8a-42bb-bf24-e2216be645f8" facs="#m-f2baf5ed-1db3-4060-b542-576e72b017e0" label="text-like">Mediant ofz accents (with an extra</l><l xml:id="m-35b85c31-db98-456d-931b-a630ce4e0b3b" facs="#m-7317f613-ae29-4d1b-9e39-4a33f2ea2ee6" label="text-like">Endings of i accent with a prepara¬</l><l xml:id="m-f1364613-879f-4f31-ae4b-52498440b216" facs="#m-26c1106e-c112-46c5-8640-dd8735a565d1" label="text-like">note added in anticipation of the accent inlables</l><l xml:id="m-61d20576-ba32-48f5-bdfa-83bb52a646fe" facs="#m-de3b9245-2b4c-47a4-9482-27e1be614615" label="ambiguous">dactylic cadences).</l><l xml:id="m-db641223-fb06-40cb-b72e-62f2a2fbe432" facs="#m-945f814a-4ac3-4205-9f4b-67f145068836" label="lyrics-like">1. Be-átus vir qui ti-met Dómi-num: *i mandá-tis é jus vó-let ni¬</l><l xml:id="m-93477144-1480-4d54-836e-90debae93f85" facs="#m-8a99462d-7308-4c64-b4cd-7c57bb24e39a" label="ambiguous">4"</l><l xml:id="m-a3de3d69-eb2f-45a4-9838-8c4b9c26d117" facs="#m-85bb9ab1-ee92-4e8c-ac83-719597a68d53" label="ambiguous">8</l><l xml:id="m-9c703dbe-fa8a-42f0-a477-a12082a656b5" facs="#m-f875482e-198e-4dcb-8c29-e43a9a7a3d26" label="lyrics-like">mis. or: ni-mis. Flex: cómmodat, t</l><l xml:id="m-f73db132-7b74-4202-8acc-a3ac2d7b05b4" facs="#m-1b4c993f-0fb2-4f4f-924f-bc99f8dc2dcb" label="lyrics-like">2. Pótens in térra érit sémen éjus: “ generâtio rectórum benedieétur.</l><l xml:id="m-62354480-4dff-48b7-a181-7eaa25a554cb" facs="#m-76614363-926a-4c7c-8afb-8e98a87a621c" label="lyrics-like">3. Glória et divitiae in dómo éjus :* et justitia éjus mánet in saéca¬</l><l xml:id="m-4fd4d55c-bf23-4ea0-b6a9-02c433ba0c56" facs="#m-961d4108-7ab6-4feb-89f6-2f9a5f736369" label="lyrics-like">lam saéculi.</l><l xml:id="m-b89fae5c-e46c-4adf-b873-59ef146b0106" facs="#m-dd47d20c-ca29-4369-ba71-27ad1fbbe1c9" label="lyrics-like">4. Exórtum est in ténebris lúmen réctis:“miséricors, et miserátor.</l><l xml:id="m-9bd86687-cc77-40ab-8673-9713a738b5b9" facs="#m-012fa6dc-7848-46d8-acc9-5858eb8431b0" label="lyrics-like">et jústus.</l><l xml:id="m-c5ff4d86-a9f9-48b2-be2c-a9d664e4389e" facs="#m-d1eb67e6-09f7-4900-806f-4e963e4af7ed" label="lyrics-like">5. Jucúndus hómo qui miserétur et cómmodat, t dispónet sermónes</l><l xml:id="m-d9cf4de1-0797-4b77-ad08-8c500ee271af" facs="#m-286c8392-e3e1-4e8a-b118-72bbf6d3d8f8" label="lyrics-like">súos in judiclo: * quia in aetérnum non commovébitur.</l><l xml:id="m-30601225-63b2-42e7-a25c-5c0520cbf1ec" facs="#m-a0236053-24db-460c-b85b-6ebcc9994843" label="lyrics-like">6. In memória aetérna érit jústus:* ab auditióne mála non timébit</l><l xml:id="m-efdae5d5-183d-4993-ad67-22a2b2b04e08" facs="#m-8a4f08ac-f649-4cf6-9ca6-babada8134a1" label="lyrics-like">7. Parátum cor éjus speráre in Dómino, ! confirmátum ést cor</l><l xml:id="m-fc8ae36e-c899-4f1c-8fde-1e33f620f174" facs="#m-60efc13f-fb55-4f2d-aa02-5de83a6933f5" label="lyrics-like">éjus: *non commovébitur donec despíciat inimicos súos.</l><l xml:id="m-60553f9c-8a7c-4b78-8bbd-fbe73216cf28" facs="#m-32a68eed-8483-4cf7-827f-7592993df962" label="lyrics-like">8. Dispérsit, dédit paupéribus: t justítia éjus mánet in saéculum</l><l xml:id="m-5fa1acfb-7026-4a1e-87ce-eebc4d429be2" facs="#m-eaf55ac7-ba84-49a5-a796-414aeeb2d5e9" label="lyrics-like">saée:córnu éjus exastábitur in glória.</l><l xml:id="m-625e1a9d-8c20-492b-8bac-0044f436dcac" facs="#m-42eddcc8-2b86-496a-bd20-d92a43362b8f" label="lyrics-like">9. Peccátor vidébit, et irascétur, f déntibus súis frémet et tabéscet:*</l><l xml:id="m-d7830efd-3eea-407c-a1e8-a22876639e71" facs="#m-8af1d2e4-28e5-4fd3-b077-103d6944ba0a" label="lyrics-like">desidérium peccatórum peribit.</l><l xml:id="m-039b651e-2b05-4bc9-9e55-25ab8a17d9e7" facs="#m-5fc6f5d3-e2bc-4666-8991-89b42adf065c" label="lyrics-like">10. Gtória Pâtri, et Fillo, * et Spirltai Sáncto.</l><l xml:id="m-84d74e13-9289-4305-9b60-4cb714ad9a63" facs="#m-01f035c5-6d84-4a6c-ac65-c164d5aded90" label="lyrics-like">11. Sicut érat in princípio, et nûne, et sémper, * et in saécula saccu¬</l><l xml:id="m-b16d69f7-d8b0-46b1-bb25-b7fa2304012e" facs="#m-61352d68-85a5-44d7-afd6-3f8fa9677f78" label="lyrics-like">tórum. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-fd6fe3af-b49e-4431-9495-5173ee071c38" facs="#m-4cc77f0a-b98f-47fa-bd09-52c637a213b2" label="ambiguous">Tone 4. g.</l><l xml:id="m-aff6cf25-35a9-4bf8-a637-a6d1676eb98d" facs="#m-ba38f695-208f-4dc0-bdff-10274501a1df" label="text-like">Ending of 1 accent.</l><l xml:id="m-f6e76bbb-8d69-4fdb-a28f-4cdf2b87ca3c" facs="#m-7480c80c-6c29-4981-892e-7438d41e56ee" label="text-like">Mediant of r accent with a preparatory</l><l xml:id="m-3ba2393a-0f07-4dc6-b661-b804b95f327d" facs="#m-906225ae-1a80-4d68-af3a-3a2e2b4f353d" label="ambiguous">syllables.</l><l xml:id="m-790e980c-e90b-4aac-855b-29d0cd383caa" facs="#m-b6166bf9-2a7c-4c58-b0f2-9c64f4486b9e" label="lyrics-like">1. Be-átus vir qui timet Dóminum:*in mandá-tis ésjus vó-let ni¬</l><l xml:id="m-be6da141-258a-4405-a6ba-aad0882ba5bf" facs="#m-ef2a2ef9-3daf-4533-8610-bd20f9f3d7c1" label="lyrics-like">mis. Flex: cómmodat, 1</l></lg>
            </div>
